  "description": "A cross-platform software sampler for NAudio that plays MIDI through SoundFont (.sf2) and SFZ instruments, or a single sample mapped across the keyboard. Polyphonic voice engine with DAHDSR envelopes, LFOs, modulated filters, the SF2 modulator engine and reverb/chorus sends, exposed as an ISampleProvider.",
